            "review_title": "Review at Vegan Buffet Anh Tam",
            "review_text": "Tran N\n1 contribution\n0\nReally recommend this place\nAug 2018\nThis is a small and cozy place. I have lunch every weekdays. The food is so good and the price is reasonable 40 thousand vnd for a pax, you can eat as much as you can. The owner is a woman of three kids, she loves to cook vegan food and want to have more incomes from this restaurant. She's very nice. Come and try. Hope you enjoy your meal\nWritten August 14, 2018",
