            "review_title": "Review at Vegan Buffet Anh Tam",
            "review_text": "Thành Đỗ\nHanoi, Vietnam6 contributions\n1\nReasonable choice for vegetarian\nAug 2018 • Friends\nI am used to having lunch here every weekday. It is a small, clean, cozy place. The foods here are absolutely for vegetarian, they do have both western and eastern taste. There are about 10+ dishes and changed everyday. Free dessert and tea. The price is reasonable (40k VND). Opens 10h-15h on weekdays.\nWritten August 11, 2018",
